Subject: CarpetReduce: Support complex reduction operations
From: Erik Schnetter <eschnetter@perimeterinstitute.ca>
Date: 2011-10-17

Provide explicit MPI reduction operators for all Cactus datatypes,
including complex numbers.

MPI does not provide datatypes for complex numbers for C or C++. The
default MPI reduction operators therefore do not support reduction
operations on complex numbers.


